MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Fix MalwareDetectionPackRequest.formats type from string[] to DetectionFormat[]
- Fix IOC normalized fallback in correlator linkRulesToMalware (use value as fallback)
- Fix Campaign linking to use malware_families instead of non-existent malware property
- Simplify ThreatActor linking (property doesn't exist directly on actor type)
- Remove invalid 'filename' key from sigma detectionMap (use 'file_path' instead)
- Change 'http_user_agent' to 'user_agent' in suricata generator switch
- Add tls_fingerprint to sigma detectionMap and fix service/process/certificate mappings
- Extend SigmaDetection index signature to include undefined for optional condition property
- Add mapSourceToFormat helper in validators to map SIEM source to DetectionFormat enum
- Fix ReportMetadata type reference in renderers (use MalwareReportMetadata)
- Fix duplicate source_confidence in IOC engine components object
- Expand export() return type to include full stats type annotation

Production TypeScript error count: 134 → 118 (16 resolved)
Remaining: ~118 test file errors (IOCType string literals)
